[TAG] Short imperative summary (<=72 chars, no trailing period)

# Only tag lines are allowed - any number, one tag per line, tags start the line.
# No free-form body. Tags:
#   [ADD] new         [UPD] update      [FIX] bug fix     [DEL] remove
#   [REF] refactor    [DOC] docs        [TST] tests       [CFG] build/ci/config
#   [DEP] dependency  [SEC] security    [PRF] performance [REV] revert
#
# No AI/Cursor co-author trailers.
# See docs/GIT.md
